Bread, Fish, Repeat 5000x — asset license index
==============================================

Game source (Odin + raylib) is authored for this project.
assets/flamendless_logo.png — author-owned.

Third-party art/audio packs (use in-game only; do not redistribute
standalone files unless the pack license allows it):

Font — Sholom
  Path: assets/fonts/sholom/
  Source: https://www.fontspace.com/sholom-font-f39980
  Follow the font author’s terms on FontSpace.

16×16 character template (8-direction)
  Path: assets/characters/
  Source: https://5yvalia.itch.io/16x16-character-template-8-direction

Nature landscape pixel art
  Path: assets/bg/
  See also: assets/bg/License.txt (Craftpix license link)
  Source: https://free-game-assets.itch.io/nature-landscapes-free-pixel-art

Fish icons atlas
  Path: assets/fishes/
  Source: https://pixel-late.itch.io/16x16-freshwater-and-saltwater-fish-icons

